TI  - LGSTA-GNN: A Local-Global Spatiotemporal Attention Graph Neural Network for Bridge Structural Damage Detection
PY  - 2026
T2  - Buildings
VL  - 16
IS  - 2
C7  - 348
DO  - 10.3390/buildings16020348
