TI  - Adaptive k-Truss-Constrained Agentic AI Framework for Resilient Multi-Agent UAV Swarm Coordination in Dynamic Disaster Environments
PY  - 2026
T2  - Electronics (Switzerland)
VL  - 15
IS  - 17
