TI  - Phase–Frequency Cooperative Optimization of HMDV Dynamic Inertial Suspension System with Generalized Ground-Hook Control
PY  - 2025
T2  - Machines
VL  - 13
IS  - 7
C7  - 556
DO  - 10.3390/machines13070556
