TI  - Determination of Dynamic Stresses and Displacements under the Action of an Impact Load on a Two-Layer Structure during the Indentation Process
PY  - 2024
T2  - Advanced Engineering Research (Rostov-on-Don)
VL  - 24
IS  - 3
SP  - 264
EP  - 273
DO  - 10.23947/2687-1653-2024-24-3-264-273
